  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Until one man came along. You. A firm believer that there are deeper truths
    to the mysterious crystals to be discovered, over many years of experiments you
    came up with a schematic for a machine more complex than any other, one that
    could attune the crystal\u2019s resonance to unlock its true potential. However,
    building such a machine would consume immense amounts of resources. Eventually,
    the situation became clear - either cut some corners, or never proceed any further.
    And so you followed through with the former option, your initial curiosity now
    turned into obsession. If you could get your hands on more crystals, you could
    use them to replace a majority of other required materials. And so you began
    hoarding them."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aa9690349e011964aaa78700753f6328, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5494141874244254509, guid: aa9690349e011964aaa78700753f6328, type: 2}
